{%- comment -%}
  Card variant 2/3 (sections/5dla_collection-product-grid.liquid's
  `product_card_type` setting picks between 5dla_product-card-1/2/3).
  Ported 1:1 (markup + CSS) from the reference's `article.model-card`
  inside `section#models` (html/revamp-collection/rendered/Fusion Tri
  Suits for Hot-Weather Racing....html). No action button group (per
  request) - the reference's own `.model-card` has none either, only the
  always-visible `.model-shop-link` at the bottom, which IS part of the
  card's own content, not a hover action group like card-1's.

  `c5dla-card-2` on the root element is this variant's CSS prefix (see
  client/ver_2_0/scss/collection/_product-card-2.scss) - same convention
  as 5dla_product-card-1.liquid's `c5dla-card-1`.

  Font: the reference page sets `--display`/`--body: "Jost", Arial,
  sans-serif` (its entire body font, not just headings) - loaded via
  sections/5dla_collection-product-grid.liquid's Google Fonts <link>
  (once per section, not once per card).

  Data mapping (per request - some fields have no real data source yet,
  so they're raw-HTML-with-dummy-text placeholders):
  - model-image: current_variant's own featured image, falling back to
    the product's featured media if the variant has none.
  - model-badge: product.metafields.bwp_fields.badge_label (blank/no
    badge rendered if not set - not every product needs one).
  - model-name-row: product.title + current_variant.price (a VARIANT
    price, not the product's general price range).
  - model-headline: product.metafields.custom.short_description.value,
    falling back to product.description, same as snippets/
    5dla_product-card-1.liquid's own `.product-short-description` (there
    it's `short_description`/`.product-short-description` - here
    `.model-headline` reuses the same data, just under this variant's own
    class name).
  - model-features: product.metafields.bwp_fields.features - a "List of
    Choice list" metafield (list.single_line_text_field), so it's already a
    plain array of strings to loop directly (no `.value` needed - unlike an
    older-style Metafield object, a LIST metafield resolves straight to its
    array in Liquid). Renders nothing if the metafield is blank/unset, same
    as model-badge above.

  model-badge is also overridden (text + optional background/text color,
  same markup) by a `custom_badge` block on `section` whose `product_list`
  includes this product - see snippets/5dla_product-card-badge-override.
  liquid.

  Expects: product, swatch_limit (unused here - kept for a consistent
  render signature with 5dla_product-card-1.liquid), section
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign current_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign model_image = current_variant.featured_image | default: product.featured_media
  assign badge_label = product.metafields.bwp_fields.badge_label
-%}

{%- capture badge_override_raw -%}
  {%- render '5dla_product-card-badge-override', product: product, section: section -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign badge_override = badge_override_raw | strip | split: ';' -%}
{%- assign badge_override_label = badge_override[0] -%}
{%- assign badge_override_bg_color = badge_override[1] -%}
{%- assign badge_override_text_color = badge_override[2] -%}
{%- if badge_override_label != blank -%}
  {%- assign badge_label = badge_override_label -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- assign short_description = product.metafields.custom.short_description.value
  | default: product.description
  | strip_html
  | truncatewords: 14
-%}

<article class="model-card c5dla-card-2">
  <div class="model-image-box">
    {%- if model_image -%}
      <img
        class="model-image"
        src="{{ model_image | image_url: width: 960 }}"
        alt="{{ model_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
        width="960"
        height="{{ 960 | divided_by: model_image.aspect_ratio }}"
      >
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if badge_label != blank -%}
      <span class="model-badge" {% render '5dla_product-card-badge-style', bg_color: badge_override_bg_color, text_color: badge_override_text_color %}>{{ badge_label }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
  <div class="model-info">
    <div class="model-name-row">
      <h3 class="model-name">{{ product.title }}</h3>
      <span class="model-price">{{ current_variant.price | money }}</span>
    </div>
    {%- if short_description != blank -%}
      <p class="model-headline">{{ short_description }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if product.metafields.bwp_fields.features != blank -%}
      <div class="model-features">
        {%- for feature in product.metafields.bwp_fields.features.value -%}
          <span class="feature-pill text-uppercase">{{ feature }}</span>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
    <a class="model-shop-link" href="{{ product.url }}">
      Shop {{ product.title }}
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.55" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</article>
